SUMMARY:14th Annual Wine Country Yarn Hop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 14th annual Northern California yarn lovers experience from July 17-19\, 2026! \nThe Wine Country Yarn Hop consists of 5 shops located in the beautiful Wine Country between Petaluma & Ukiah. \nThe 2026 Yarn Hop is FREE and begins July 17\, 2026 at 10:00am. The Hop is 3 days long\, you can choose to do all 5 shops in one day\, or spread it out and hop all weekend. \nAll 5 shops are open from 10:00 – 5:00 each day of the Hop: July 17\, 18 & 19. \nYou will receive a passport to be stamped at each shop\, as well as 1 raffle ticket per stop. Participants will be entered to win a prize basket at each shop\, AND the Grand Prize basket when a complete passport is turned in. FREE patterns\, and free enamel pins w/ tote or lanyard purchase. \nNo need to register – just start hopping at any of the 5 shops! \nLearn more: winecountryyarnhop.com \nFiber Circle Studios- Petaluma\nNoma Knits- Sonoma\nCast Away Yarn Shop- Santa Rosa\nPurls of Joy- Healdsburg\nPurple Needle- Ukiah
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/14th-annual-wine-country-yarn-hop-2/
LOCATION:Cast Away Yarn Shop\, 100 4th Str\, Santa Rosa\, 95401
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
