SUMMARY:Sonoma County Hot Air Balloon Classic
DESCRIPTION:Rise & Shine at the Balloon Festival!\nLooking for a magical way to start your day? Join us for an unforgettable two-day Balloon Festival packed with fun for all ages!\n4 AM Glow Show – Watch the sky come alive as glowing balloons flicker like fireflies in the early morning darkness. It’s a breathtaking sight you won’t want to miss!\nFREE Kids Zone – After the glow show\, let the little ones run wild with games and activities designed just for them.\nFood & Vendors – Grab delicious bites\, browse unique merchandise\, and soak in the festive atmosphere while we prepare for potential balloon launches. Weather permitting.\nTethered Balloon Rides – Weather permitting\, experience the thrill of rising gently above the ground for a one-of-a-kind view!\nBring your friends\, bring your family\, and come create unforgettable memories together. Start your morning with wonder\, laughter\, and a sky full of color!\nDon’t miss out—plan your visit today!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sonoma-county-hot-air-balloon-classic/
LOCATION:Sonoma County Fairgrounds\, 1350 Bennett Valley Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival,Other
END:VEVENT
