SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Pepper On The Run
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come together. \nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tasting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from across the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new sounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \nPepper On The Run\nThe Pepper On The Run band is a tribute to the music of Sir Paul McCartney from The Beatles\, Wings and early solo songs! Pepper On The Run plays all of his greatest music\, while leaving out the ones that are too schmaltzy (No “Silly Love Songs” I “Say Say Say” here). One fan calls them\, “Beatles with balls!” They’re based in the San Francisco Bay Area. \nDetails\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/saturday-live-music-at-spicy-vines-feat-pepper-on-the-run/
LOCATION:Spicy Vines\, 441 Healdsburg Ave.\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
