SUMMARY:Sonoma Sundays on the Plaza - MIP All Stars
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Music in Place and the City of Sonoma invite you to soak up the sunshine\, sip local wine\, and dance to live music at the Sonoma Plaza Grinstead Amphitheater during Sonoma Sundays On the Plaza\, a free concert series running June 7 through October 4\, 2026. \nThis week’s lineup features Howard Paul and the MIP All Stars! Howard Paul is an acclaimed jazz guitarist and President/CEO of Benedetto Guitars\, a celebrated jazz guitar manufacturing company founded in 1968. Growing up near Atlantic City\, NJ\, he’s played guitar since age 4\, and focused exclusively on jazz since age 10. \nSonoma Sundays are free and open to all\, thanks to the generous support of the Sonoma Community Center\, The Dawn Redwoods Trust\, and the McNeely Family Foundation. \nPack your picnic\, bring your dancing shoes\, and meet us on the Plaza!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sonoma-sundays-on-the-plaza-mip-all-stars/
LOCATION:Grinstead Amphitheater – Sonoma Plaza\, 453 1st St E\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
